// Greybox stand-in for Sable at the Drowned Quay. Cryptic register (style guide 6).
// Real Saltmarrow writing is NAR-04; this exists so the dialogue pipeline can be felt in-engine.
// She also carries two Commissions for the greybox: the Bone Bridge's second step and the Tether-Widows.

title: Greybox_Sable
---
<<if has_flag("greybox.met_sable")>>
    <<jump Greybox_Sable_Again>>
<<endif>>
Sable: Wings high, stranger. You've come a long way to be lost.
Sable: Guild cowl. No licence on you. No atlas either.
-> Where is this?
    Sable: The Saltmarrow. The far side of everything.
    Sable: The Blank spat you out here. It does that, sometimes.
-> There was a kite. Isolde Marr.
    Sable: Nobody came out but you. Nobody ever comes out. #plant:5.2
-> ...
    Sable: Quiet suits you. Cheaper, too.
Sable: Quay's up the boardwalk. Everything there has a price. Including me.
<<flag greybox.met_sable 1>>
===

title: Greybox_Sable_Again
---
<<if place_fate("Saltmarrow_A") == "anchored">>
    Sable: Anchored, then. The same tide every day now. You'll get used to it. Everyone does. #still
<<elseif place_fate("Saltmarrow_A") == "held">>
    Sable: Held, is it. Roll-call at dusk. Don't be late; a bird nobody names is a bird nobody keeps. #still
<<elseif place_fate("Saltmarrow_A") == "released">>
    Sable: You let it go. Honest, at least. I'll ask the price of a tether while there's still a quay to sell it from. #still
<<else>>
    Sable: Still here. Still lost.
<<endif>>
<<if erased("Saltmarrow_B")>>
    Sable: Bells in the reeds. Merrow's End went off your page, didn't it. Draw it again; that's what the quill is for. #plant:3.3
<<endif>>
<<if commission_is("saltmarrow.tether_widows", "taken") and not has_flag("saltmarrow.widow.decided")>>
    <<jump Greybox_Sable_Widow>>
<<endif>>
<<if surveyed("Saltmarrow_A/Reedmother")>>
    Sable: You drew the Reedmother. Hm. Maybe you are Guild after all.
    <<if commission_is("saltmarrow.bone_bridge", "taken") and not has_flag("saltmarrow.bone_bridge.heard")>>
        Sable: Whale sang while you were up there. Under the bridge. You hear it?
        -> I heard it. It sounded like names.
            Sable: Everyone says names. Nobody agrees whose. #plant:3.4
            <<flag saltmarrow.bone_bridge.heard 1>>
        -> I heard nothing.
            Sable: Then you weren't listening. Go again. It'll wait. It's bones.
    <<endif>>
<<else>>
    Sable: There's a vantage by the old reed. Draw it, if you're what your cowl says.
<<endif>>
<<if not has_flag("greybox.sable.ledger")>>
    Sable: Board by the desk is the ledger. People write what they want and can't say aloud. Read that far down, if you like.
    <<flag greybox.sable.ledger 1>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Greybox_Sable_Widow
---
Sable: The widow at the tether-post asked after you. First time she's asked after anyone.
Sable: She means to go in after him. Rope's already round her waist.
-> Talk her out of it.
    Sable: I'll pass it on. She won't listen. They never do, and then they do.
    <<flag saltmarrow.widow.decided 1>>
-> Let her go. Somebody should go with her.
    Sable: Then it's you. I'll hold the other end. I've held worse.
    <<flag saltmarrow.widow.decided 2>>
===
